              <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-4">
                <div><h3 class="font-bold text-base text-[#091e42]">Email Templates</h3><p class="text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Enable or disable each automated notification email.</p></div>
